# Common-emitter amplifier, REVISION A -- the approved print, kept
# beside amp.d the way sec. 50 says a revision is kept: as a FILE.
#	veldiff       amp.d.A amp.d	what changed
#	veldiff -mark amp.d.A amp.d > mark.d	... on paper
# Since A: the output coupling (C2, J2, the OUT net) was added, the
# emitter bypass C3 came off, R2 was re-valued and R3 moved down.
vellum1
T 32 8 s2 Common emitter amp
Y VCC 44 14 0 0 - -
Y VCC 52 14 0 0 - -
Y R 44 18 1 0 R1 47k
Y R 52 18 1 0 R2 3k3
Y NPN 50 30 0 0 Q1 BC237
Y R 44 32 1 0 R3 10k
Y R 52 34 1 0 R4 1k
Y C 58 34 1 0 C3 10u
Y GND 44 40 0 0 - -
Y GND 52 40 0 0 - -
Y C 36 30 0 0 C1 100n
Y J 28 30 0 0 J1 in
W 44 14 44 18
W 52 14 52 18
W 44 22 44 30
W 44 30 44 32
W 44 30 50 30
W 52 22 52 28
W 52 32 52 34
W 44 36 44 40
W 52 38 52 40
W 30 30 36 30
W 38 30 44 30
N 32 30 IN
